
=== Benchmark: whereElement Performance ===
Vector size: 10000
Number of searches: 10000

Original (start=0 always):
  Found 10000/10000 elements
#NO_DIFF#   Time: 16438 microseconds

Optimized (start=lastPos):
  Found 10000/10000 elements
#NO_DIFF#   Time: 34 microseconds

=== Benchmark Complete ===
Note: The optimized version reduces complexity from O(n²) to O(n)
      For larger datasets (millions of points), the improvement is dramatic.
